# Remove boxed upper cluster

Removed only upper cluster index 3 at azimuth 315, elevation 35 degrees from
the v09 assembly. The requested cloud was confirmed using a static 315-degree
viewport comparison matching the user's marked image. Other upper clusters,
hero shapes, horizon groups and rear atmosphere remain unchanged.

Current level actor uses
`/Game/RXSkySystem/Cubeless/PaintedCloud/v03/Fragmented_v10/T_PaintedCloud_FragmentedClean_v03`.
RGBA rules and 4K polar projection are unchanged. Source/readback pixels match;
the level's time, rear texture and all scalar controls were preserved.

Before/after view evidence and backup:
`MCPGameProject/Saved/PaintedEvolutionV03/FragmentedClean/`.
